    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-06T17:17:54+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-06T17:17:54+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-06T06:47:54Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-06T06:47:54Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system located to the south of SA will maintain a ridge over the state as it moves into the Tasman Sea from late Wednesday. A trough ahead of a strong cold front is then expected move over western SA on Thursday, before the front tracks east across the rest of SA on Friday and early Saturday. A high will quickly move southeast across the state on Saturday, ahead of another front forecast to move across on Sunday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW010" description="West Coast" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-06T15:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-07T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-06T04:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-06T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Clear. Winds south to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h turning southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h in the evening.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-07T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-08T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-06T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-07T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northwest to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the middle of the day then tending northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 11 with daytime temperatures reaching around 30.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:50am to 4:50pm, UV Index predicted to reach 9 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-08T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-09T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-07T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-08T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny morning. High chance of showers in the late afternoon and evening. The chance of a thunderstorm in the afternoon and evening, possibly severe with damaging winds west of Ceduna. Winds east to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h turning north to northwesterly 25 to 40 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 10 and 18 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 30s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-09T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-10T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-08T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-09T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Very high chance of showers east of Ceduna, high chance elsewhere. A thunderstorm likely in the morning and afternoon, possibly severe with damaging winds east of Ceduna. Winds north to northwesterly 15 to 20 km/h turning west to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h during the morning then decreasing to 15 to 20 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 14 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-10-10T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-11T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-09T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-10T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower south of Streaky Bay, near zero chance elsewhere. Winds northwest to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northeast to southeasterly during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 9 with daytime temperatures reaching between 19 and 25.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
